    <string name="compose_local_agent_screenshot_description">Screenshots are off by default. To let the planner see the screen, set the Tasker variable CB_LocalAgentScreenshot to 1 in the CyanBridge Local Agent profile. Tasker then sends a screenshot with each observation, and CyanBridge deletes it after the planning step. With a cloud or Pro planner, the screenshot is sent to that provider.</string>
